From 0afe080cd633a71ee8005d39df824d83bc9d3b98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tu-kim <taewoo89.kim@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 11:48:52 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] profile: ENV-gated agent-loop instrumentation

Adds opencode/packages/opencode/src/profile/profile.ts plus 5 hook call
sites in session/prompt.ts and session/processor.ts. Captures per-query
e2e latency, per-step LLM/tool wall-clock split, ISL/OSL from server-
reported usage tokens, and per-step modelMsgs snapshots. NDJSON output
at \$OPENCODE_PROFILE_DIR/<sessionID>.jsonl. When OPENCODE_PROFILE is
unset/0/false every hook is a no-op.

tool.start/end pair fires through Effect.onExit so defects (Tool.execute
uses Effect.orDie) still produce a paired tool.end with ok:false.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
